---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="GNED07 | Syllabus">
	<main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-12 animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-bottom-8 duration-700 mt-8 px-6 pb-24">
		
		<div class="border-b border-white/10 pb-8 relative">
			<div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-72 h-72 bg-cyan-500/10 blur-[100px] rounded-full pointer-events-none z-[-1]"></div>
			<span class="text-cyan-400 text-sm font-bold tracking-widest mb-2 block uppercase">Syllabus Overview</span>
			<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-4">
				Course Methodology.
			</h1>
			<p class="text-lg text-slate-400 max-w-2xl font-light">
				Understanding the academic framework and expected learning outcomes for the GNED07 Cycle Theory module.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-12">
			
			<div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-8 text-slate-300 font-light leading-relaxed">
				<section>
					<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">Course Objectives</h2>
					<p class="mb-4">
						By the end of this module, students will be able to identify macro-historical patterns and apply cyclical frameworks to modern socio-economic events. We will move beyond linear history to understand how human behavior creates predictable, repeating epochs.
					</p>
					<p>
						This course challenges students to critically analyze primary sources, demographic data, and economic indicators to forecast potential future shifts.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 border border-white/5 relative overflow-hidden">
					<div class="absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-1 bg-cyan-500"></div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-white mb-3">Assessment & Grading</h3>
					<ul class="space-y-3 text-sm">
						<li class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/5 pb-2">
							<span>Interactive Chapter Quizzes</span>
							<span class="text-cyan-400 font-medium">30%</span>
						</li>
						<li class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/5 pb-2">
							<span>Historical Pattern Essay</span>
							<span class="text-cyan-400 font-medium">40%</span>
						</li>
						<li class="flex justify-between items-center">
							<span>Final Capstone Projection</span>
							<span class="text-cyan-400 font-medium">30%</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</section>
			</div>

			<div class="space-y-6">
				<div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950 border border-white/10 shadow-xl">
					<h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-4 border-b border-white/10 pb-2">Course Details</h3>
					
					<div class="space-y-4 text-sm">
						<div>
							<span class="block text-slate-500 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Code</span>
							<span class="text-slate-200 font-medium">GNED07</span>
						</div>
						<div>
							<span class="block text-slate-500 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Prerequisites</span>
							<span class="text-slate-200 font-medium">None</span>
						</div>
						<div>
							<span class="block text-slate-500 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Format</span>
							<span class="text-slate-200 font-medium">Digital Interactive</span>
						</div>
						<div>
							<span class="block text-slate-500 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Est. Completion</span>
							<span class="text-slate-200 font-medium">4 Hours</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

		</div>

	</main>
</Layout>